WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Music] Ask five AI agents to plan a road trip, and you get five different shapes.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Open Itinerary. One format for travel plans. Agents output it. Apps consume it.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
A KDL format agents write cheaply: 27% fewer tokens on the SF to LA example.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Apps render it.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
Validate it with a JSON Schema. Valid Open Itinerary v0.2 document.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
Boring, useful, and open. bryanhu.com/open-itin
